{
  "about": "The re-shoot's Brightness shot, on the plain afternoon screen (Light, the filter off): Brightness dragged from full down to 35% and, after a moment, back up, the display's backlight following. Filmed by two fixed panes, the whole screen and the popover close up with the menu bar's clock, with no camera move",
